table:
  name: {{prefix}}pool_periods
  schema: {{schema}}
configuration:
  comment: "One month of the pool: what has come out of it. Granted and overdraft amounts move only in admit and spend."
insert_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      check: {}
      columns:
        - checkedAt
        - driftFactor
        - ledgerCents
        - periodStart
        - providerCents
    comment: The server's own writes. No other role ever writes here.
select_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      columns:
        - checkedAt
        - driftFactor
        - grantedCredits
        - grantedUsd
        - ledgerCents
        - notifiedEmptyAt
        - notifiedLowAt
        - notifiedOverAt
        - overdraftUsd
        - periodStart
        - providerCents
        - updatedAt
      filter: {}
      allow_aggregations: true
    comment: The server reads everything here.
update_permissions:
  - role: {{server_role}}
    permission:
      columns:
        - checkedAt
        - driftFactor
        - ledgerCents
        - notifiedEmptyAt
        - notifiedLowAt
        - notifiedOverAt
        - providerCents
      filter: {}
      check: null
    comment: The server's bookkeeping. Balances and money move only in the row-locked functions.
